            "contentId": "ch1_4055",
            "content": {
                "en": "Simply put, these people want to loop a sound effect beside their stall. I was only asked to come over and set up the program for them.",
                "zh": "简单来说，这些人想要用印象在摊位旁边循环播放一个音效，我本来只是过来帮他们设定好程序的。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 606.0,
            "positionY": 1068.0,
            "choices": [],
